  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">KAOS GL 2025 - Empowering Professionals for LGBTI+ Inclusive Services</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The &quot;Empowering Professionals for LGBTI+ Inclusive Services&quot; project aims to enhance the capacity of social workers, Guidance and Psychological Counselors (K12 level), psychologists, and lawyers in Turkey to provide inclusive and supportive services for LGBTI+ individuals.</narrative>
  </description>
